Package: FTucker3
Title: Tucker Decomposition for Three-Way Functional Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Roberto William",
           family = "Cascante Yarlequé",
           email = "rcascantey@unemi.edu.ec",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements a basis-preserving Tucker decomposition for three-way
    functional data using a common orthonormal Fourier basis. Functional
    observations are represented through a fourth-order coefficient tensor,
    and structural loading matrices are estimated using alternating
    orthogonal updates based on singular value decomposition. Provides
    functional reconstruction, convergence diagnostics, and cell-wise
    cross-validation for structural rank selection. The underlying
    methodology is described in Cascante-Yarlequé et al. (2026)
    <doi:10.3390/math14193589>.
